{"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "query": "Unit tests for an Arduino Uno module: Parameter menu on a 20x4 I2C LCD with rotary encoder and EEPROM. Pins: pin 3 INPUT_PULLUP encoder CLK (external interrupt); pin 2 INPUT_PULLUP encoder DT (external interrupt); pin 4 INPUT_PULLUP encoder push button SW (LOW = pressed); pin 18 I2C LCD SDA (A4); pin 19 I2C LCD SCL (A5). Arduino API used: attachInterrupt, delay, digitalPinToInterrupt, digitalRead, millis, pinMode, sizeof. Libraries: LiquidCrystal I2C, RotaryEncoder. Library API used: Copyright, backlight, blink, clear, digitalRead, getPosition, init, noBlink, setCursor, setPosition, tick. Simulated devices: wokwi-lcd2004, wokwi-ky-040. Functions to test: void menu_init(), void menu_check_button(uint16_t enter_pause_ms, uint16_t save_pause_ms), void menu_button_event(uint16_t held_ms, uint16_t enter_pause_ms, uint16_t save_pause_ms), void menu_long_click(uint16_t enter_pause_ms, uint16_t save_pause_ms), void menu_single_click(), void menu_edit_vars(), void menu_apply_delta(int16_t delta), void menu_render(), void menu_idle_screen(), void menu_write_eeprom(), void menu_read_eeprom(), void menu_encoder_isr(), bool menu_setup_mode(), uint8_t menu_selected(), MenuVarType menu_var_type(uint8_t index), float menu_value(uint8_t index), const char* menu_lcd_line(uint8_t row).", "embedding": [-0.07037353515625, 0.0037746429443359375, -0.027862548828125, -0.054107666015625, -0.01174163818359375, 0.0119476318359375, 0.0193634033203125, 0.001560211181640625, 0.034942626953125, -0.003406524658203125, 0.0396728515625, -0.0645751953125, -0.031982421875, 0.0506591796875, 0.019500732421875, -0.011993408203125, 0.0193634033203125, 0.0228118896484375, -0.05426025390625, 0.030914306640625, 0.041748046875, 0.00469207763671875, 0.03436279296875, 0.028594970703125, 0.0010013580322265625, -0.066650390625, 0.00844573974609375, 0.001956939697265625, 0.010162353515625, -0.01285552978515625, 0.0110015869140625, -0.023162841796875, -0.026077270507812